# Melo

> Melo is a corporate communications agency in São Paulo, Brazil, that turns technical authority into brand authority. Melo é uma agência de comunicação corporativa em São Paulo que traduz autoridade técnica em autoridade de marca.

Melo (also known as Melo Creative) works with B2B and technical companies that already deliver well but whose communication does not show it: healthcare and healthtech, technology and data, law firms, education, industry and engineering. Strategy, brand, culture, institutional communication, websites and film are handled under one direction, by an in-house team, since 2020. More than 3,000 deliveries and 50+ brands. Rated 5.0 on Google.

